msgid ""
"Chris Bernhardt. [Quantum Computing for "
"Everyone.](https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262539531/quantum-computing-for-"
"everyone/)\n"
msgstr ""
"Chris Bernhardt. [Quantum Computing for "
"Everyone.](https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262539531/quantum-computing-for-"
"everyone/)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thomas Wong. [Introduction to Classical and Quantum "
